feat(frontend): React + Vite setup, Tailwind CSS, Auth flow, Event discovery & QR ticket display

- Initialize React 19 + Vite frontend with Tailwind CSS & PostCSS
- Configure dark mode styling with ThemeContext and localStorage persistence
- Implement Axios client with credentials (withCredentials: true) and 401 token rotation interceptor
- Implement AuthContext with cookie session checking, login, register, and role helpers
- Implement glassmorphic Navbar with role badges, search, and dark mode toggle
- Implement Home page with hero section, category grid, and featured events
- Implement Events catalog page with live search, category pills, city selector, and price filters
- Implement EventDetail page with capacity progress, organizer info, and 1-click registration
- Implement TicketModal displaying QR code data URI and cryptographic ticket identifier
- Implement MyTickets page allowing users to view digital passes and cancel registrations
- Implement CreateEvent page for organizers and admins to publish events
- Verified with clean production build (npm run build succeeded with 0 errors)
